# IPL Match API

This project is a small Flask API for querying IPL match data from `ipl-matches.csv`.

## Files

- `app.py` - Flask application and API routes.
- `ipl.py` - Data loading and IPL statistics helper functions.
- `ipl-matches.csv` - Match dataset used by the API.
- `calculation.ipynb` - Notebook used for analysis or experimentation.

## Requirements

Install the Python dependencies:

```bash
pip install flask pandas numpy
```

## Run

Start the API:

```bash
python app.py
```

By default, Flask runs at:

```text
http://127.0.0.1:5000
```

## Endpoints

### Home

```text
GET /
```

Returns a simple home page response.

### Teams

```text
GET /api/teams
```

Returns the list of teams in the dataset.

### Team vs Team

```text
GET /api/teamvteam?team1=<team-name>&team2=<team-name>
```

Returns head-to-head records between two teams.

### Team Record

```text
GET /api/allrecoed?team=<team-name>
```

Returns overall match record for one team.
